    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Haidian began as a village outside Beijing’s Inner City before becoming a modern tech hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haidian%2C_Beijing"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Haidian hosts dozens of top universities, including Tsinghua, Peking, and Renmin, making it China’s academic heart.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haidian%2C_Beijing"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since the reform, Haidian has evolved into the heart of China’s IT industry, home to giants like Baidu and Xiaomi.",
